{
  "caption": "Modal Verbs",
  "variant": "grammar",
  "head": [
    [
      {
        "text": "Modal",
        "tone": "pos"
      },
      {
        "text": "Use",
        "tone": "neg"
      },
      {
        "text": "Example",
        "tone": "q"
      }
    ]
  ],
  "body": [
    [
      {
        "text": "Can",
        "header": true,
        "tone": "pos",
        "rowSpan": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "1-Ability",
        "header": true
      },
      "Noah can learn many languages at the same time."
    ],
    [
      {
        "text": "*To be able to (expression with the same function)",
        "header": true
      },
      "Leo is able to speak Spanish fluently."
    ],
    [
      {
        "text": "2-Permission",
        "header": true
      },
      "Can I borrow your notes to study?"
    ],
    [
      {
        "text": "3-Possibility",
        "header": true
      },
      "They can visit the museum in their free time."
    ],
    [
      {
        "text": "4-Offers",
        "header": true
      },
      "We can buy food at the convenience store."
    ],
    [
      {
        "text": "Could",
        "header": true,
        "tone": "neg",
        "rowSpan": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "1-Ability (in the past)",
        "header": true
      },
      "Noah could learn many languages when he was a child"
    ],
    [
      {
        "text": "2-Permission (very formal)",
        "header": true
      },
      "Could I take a photo of your dog?"
    ],
    [
      {
        "text": "3-Possibility",
        "header": true
      },
      "Gabriel could be at the park."
    ],
    [
      {
        "text": "4-Offers",
        "header": true
      },
      "Could I help you organize the invitations?"
    ],
    [
      {
        "text": "5-Probability",
        "header": true
      },
      "It could rain today."
    ],
    [
      {
        "text": "Should / Ought to",
        "header": true,
        "tone": "q",
        "rowSpan": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "1-Necessity",
        "header": true
      },
      "All tourists should/ought to follow the guide’s instructions."
    ],
    [
      {
        "text": "2-Advice",
        "header": true
      },
      "You should/ought to rest for the next days."
    ],
    [
      {
        "text": "Have to",
        "header": true,
        "tone": "nq"
      },
      {
        "text": "1-Necessity",
        "header": true
      },
      "The students have to finish the activity before leaving."
    ],
    [
      {
        "text": "Don’t have to / Don’t need to / Needn’t",
        "header": true,
        "tone": "purple"
      },
      {
        "text": "1-Absence of necessity",
        "header": true
      },
      {
        "lines": [
          "You don’t have to cook this week.",
          "She doesn’t need to bring the snacks.",
          "She needn’t present the project in front of everyone."
        ]
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "text": "May",
        "header": true,
        "tone": "teal",
        "rowSpan": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "1-Permission (formal)",
        "header": true
      },
      "May I go to the library for the books?"
    ],
    [
      {
        "text": "2-Possibility",
        "header": true
      },
      "Mia may be with her sister in her room."
    ],
    [
      {
        "text": "3-Probability",
        "header": true
      },
      "Our teacher will be absent today. She may cancel today’s class."
    ],
    [
      {
        "text": "Might",
        "header": true,
        "tone": "blue",
        "rowSpan": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "1-Possibility",
        "header": true
      },
      "I might go to the mall tonight."
    ],
    [
      {
        "text": "2-Probability",
        "header": true
      },
      "Our teacher will be absent today. She might cancel today’s class."
    ],
    [
      {
        "text": "Can’t / Mustn’t",
        "header": true,
        "tone": "neg"
      },
      {
        "text": "1-Prohibition",
        "header": true
      },
      {
        "lines": [
          "People under eighteen years old can’t enter this area.",
          "You mustn’t touch the animals."
        ]
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "text": "Must",
        "header": true,
        "tone": "q",
        "rowSpan": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "1-Obligation",
        "header": true
      },
      "I must attend the lecture."
    ],
    [
      {
        "text": "2-Deduction or assumption",
        "header": true
      },
      "Ava has been working out for two hours; she must be thirsty."
    ],
    [
      {
        "text": "Would",
        "header": true,
        "tone": "nq"
      },
      {
        "text": "1-Offers",
        "header": true
      },
      "Would you like some ice tea?"
    ],
    [
      {
        "text": "Will",
        "header": true,
        "tone": "pos"
      },
      {
        "text": "1-Probability",
        "header": true
      },
      "The new book will become the best seller of the year."
    ],
    [
      {
        "text": "Shall",
        "header": true,
        "tone": "teal",
        "rowSpan": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "1-Advice",
        "header": true
      },
      "Shall we meet at the cinema tomorrow?"
    ],
    [
      {
        "text": "2-Offers",
        "header": true
      },
      "Shall I drive you to the bus station?"
    ]
  ]
}
